        "TileImage": "$($repository ec17e969-b5e0-45c7-a9c1-5c6be2e1dee3).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47,\r\rApparently the file obtained from Don Yate&apos;s home has the profiles of new Providence members on it, it appears they also rebranded to &quot;Lechery&quot; and Mr. Wong is at the heart of the whole operation.\r\rThe Burg Al-Ghazali is having it&apos;s grand opening and 2 of the memebers or Lechery will be attending along with an agent who plans to eliminate our new client, Julian De Craven.\r\rAll 3 of these people must be handled and we have to be discreet.\r\rGood Luck 47.",
